      "description": "This folder covers the full suite of CRUD operations against the Reqres REST API. It includes requests to retrieve paginated user lists (pages 1, 2, and 3), fetch individual users by ID, create a new user, perform a full update (PUT) and a partial update (PATCH) on an existing user, delete a user, and handle edge cases such as requesting a non-existent user. Together, these requests provide end-to-end coverage of the Reqres user resource endpoints."
    },
